    "Visible enclosures are numbered or fixed. Leaf veins are open strokes rather than separate blank regions; fixed scarf fringe, feet, eye highlights, mushroom underside/gloss and grass remain filled. No enclosed transparent unpaintable components were found.",
    "All fixed colored pixels agree exactly with current original RGB. Seven contrasting choices and repeated scarf/spine/tan regions satisfy the working age-4+ variety criterion."
